Suggested order
---------------
Cheapest and most informative first: L1 and L2 (under $0.10, and they shape what everything
after costs), A2 and A1 (about $0.16), then B1 (about $0.50), then one
structure the circle can't test (D1 rope, or D2 ants), then C3 repair, which is the Atlas's
"most important act" and still untried. E1 whenever the person picks the work.
